claim.claim-text:
determining whether the speaker of an utterance is not a known user of a user device that is shared by a plurality of known users;
in response to determining that the speaker is not a known user, determining whether the utterance corresponds to a personal request or non-personal request; and
in response to determining that the utterance corresponds to a non-personal request:

generating a query that includes at least authentication tokens that correspond to the plurality of known users of the user device and a representation of the utterance;
transmitting the query to a remote server; and
receiving, from the remote server, an indication of whether the speaker is a known user of the user device or not a known user of the user device.

generating a query that includes at least a representation of the utterance;
transmitting the query to a remote server; and
receiving, from the remote server, an indication of whether the utterance corresponds to a personal request or non-personal request.
